        <p>In the competitive landscape of liquid product development, the choice of delivery system is often the pivot point between commercial success and technical failure. Whether you are launching a high-end cosmetic mist, a heavy-duty industrial cleaner, or a specialized pharmaceutical spray, understanding the fluid dynamics and mechanical engineering behind aerosol, pump, and trigger systems is critical. This guide dissects these technologies to help founders make data-driven decisions that balance performance, cost, and user experience.</p>

        
